 "texts": [
  "'an app where Celtic season-ticket holders pass their seat to\nanother fan for matches they can't attend.' a bare idea \u2014 nothing\ndeclared, nothing on disk. the ENTRY GATES push it to the top:\nno rung below PRODUCT will admit work whose inputs don't exist.",
