  "An idea arrives: Celtic Ticket Exchange",
  "BLUE \u2014 changed since you last marked this reviewed",
  "CELTIC TICKET EXCHANGE \u2014 the whole flow, spark to shipped",
  "CHOOSE",
  "CONTRACT",
  "Choose what matters next",
  "DECISIONS are dashed  \u00b7  ARTIFACTS are listed right",
  "DEEPER \u2014 THE LOOP MAY NOT RUN YET. nothing in any repo can refuse\nfrom outside the model: 0 CI workflows, 0 hooks. until a check can\nBLOCK, this page is a description, not a machine. CI is the first\nbuild item for exactly this reason \u2014 and deciding its shape (what\nrefuses, where, on what signal) is yours.",
  "DEEPER \u2014 THE VALUE, IN UNITS. what is this worth, and to whom:\nempty seats filled? fan goodwill? money? every fatal-risk verdict\nand every priority call downstream divides by this number, and it\nhas exactly one source: you.",
  "DEEPER \u2014 UK LAW MAKES UNAUTHORISED FOOTBALL TICKET RESALE A\nCRIMINAL OFFENCE (s.166 CJPOA 1994 \u2014 from training data; have\ncounsel verify). impact >= the declared value at ANY likelihood =\nFATAL. the only countermeasure class visible is CLUB AUTHORISATION\n\u2014 which makes partner-with-Celtic the survival condition, not a\nfeature. face-value-only exchange between verified holders may be\nthe one lawful shape. this risk can reshape or kill the idea.",
  "DEEPER \u2014 YOUR EXPERT-USER PASS, DEFINED. what do you DO to say\ngoal achieved: list a real ticket, transfer it to a real fan,\nstand at the turnstile when the QR scans? the pass is experiential\nby design \u2014 naming its scenario is the one gate only you can write.",
  "DESIGN",
  "Design the solution \u2192 ONE package",
  "Drive to done \u2014 unattended",
  "FRAME",
  "Frame the intent \u2192 an IDEA BRIEF",
  "GOAL\nGATE",
  "GREEN \u2014 Tony's input into the work: his annotations, his corrections",
  "LOOP",
  "Prove the whole \u00b7 Goal gate",
  "RED BOX \u2014 a place where Tony must think more deeply before the flow may pass (overrides red=cost, boxes only)",
  "RED \u2014 cost, or a route that leaves the stage / blocks it",
  "Release shipped \u2192 the flow repeats",
  "SHIPPED",
  "SLICE",
  "SPARK",
  "Slice a release \u00b7 Set the goal",
  "Test viability \u2192 qualify the killer assumption",
  "VIABILITY",
  "Write the contract \u00b7 Size and assign",
  "a release is a GROUPING, not a date. MVP candidate: verified\nseason-ticket holders only \u00b7 home league games \u00b7 face value only\n(the lawful shape) \u00b7 one club-blessed pilot stand. dependency\nforbids groupings, what a user can absorb caps them, effort/risk/\nopportunity shape the rest. DONE is ASSEMBLED: every item is a\ncheck against something an earlier stage declared.",
  "a worked example through every agreed rung \u00b7 drawn 2026-08-04\nskills + tools in the right gutter \u00b7 the flow is the WALK's agreed system, not today's tooling.",
  "cold eyes see ONLY the work order and the change \u2014 verdict can\nBLOCK. per-layer conformance, never one verdict: code \u00b7 logic \u00b7\narchitecture \u00b7 pixel vs the approved design \u00b7 the product\nmeasurements (an exchange completes end-to-end, the seat\ntransfers, the empty-seat number moves). then the human key.",
  "every candidate-fatal risk gets EVIDENCE \u2014 a test or an analysis \u2014\nimpact in the value's units, likelihood recorded separately, never\nmultiplied. candidates here: will fans list through a non-club\napp? can a seat actually transfer inside the club's ticketing\nsystem? is resale even lawful? a risk left unqualified reads as\nmanaged \u2014 that is the failure this stage exists to stop.",
  "next unblocked piece \u2192 build \u2192 prove against ALL RELEVANT specs \u2192\ncommit as it verifies \u2192 repeat. the driver holds nothing: state\nlives in the declared artifacts, so it cuts and resumes fresh\nbetween pieces. every question rides the LADDER \u2014 builder \u2192\noverseer \u2192 intent-holder \u2192 you \u2014 and only a role-unanswerable\nblocker reaches you. the liveness view ticks at every piece\nboundary: landed \u00b7 in flight \u00b7 remaining. motion, not 'working\u2026'.",
  "one conversation \u2192 docs/design/celtic-ticket-exchange.md +\n.excalidraw: detailed specs, architecture (ticket custody, QR\nre-issue, seat map, identity), testing strategy, diagrams for as\nmany aspects as we can. grounding: standing decisions \u00b7 what we\nruled out \u00b7 the living design docs of whatever this touches.\nGO is two keys: everything drawn and nothing left to annotate\n(you) \u00b7 every stage-2 measurement has a NAMED ANSWER (machine).\nGO writes docs/gates/<date>-celtic-ticket-exchange-design.md.",
  "skills: interrogate serves\nthis today. the SPIKE is the\ncheapest test of the killer\nassumption \u2014 declared, cheap,\nkill-or-keep.",
  "skills: sensei IF its route\nmatches (asserting a position).\nsherpa Explore is the drafted\nserver \u2014 unused today.\nacceptance: machine key +\nTony approves the brief.",
  "skills: sherpa Launch drafted\nfor this \u2014 unused today.\nrisk arrives PRE-QUALIFIED\nfrom viability; never\nre-argued here.",
  "switch + kivna keep the\nboundary \u00b7 the vault tells the\nhuman story \u00b7 git holds every\ndeclaration the checks\nmeasure against.",
  "the design package arrives INTACT \u2014 never a digest. the work\norder: self-contained pieces ('listing service', 'seat-transfer\nflow', 'holder-verification screen'), each carrying its own check,\nsized and assigned AFTER writing. two-tier access: the overseer\nholds all truth; each builder gets exactly its piece plus related\nmaterials. NO human gate \u2014 every piece measurable against an\nupstream declaration, or pushed back to design.",
  "the gate record is dated and kept; the code IS the product truth;\nwhat was ruled out is on the record and read in grounding by the\nnext round \u2014 a dead option stays dead. the next slice (away\nfixtures? cup games? guest passes?) enters at the gates \u2014 and\nenters LOWER, because its upstream declarations now exist.",
  "this is the escalation\ncontract's promised report:\nGOAL ACHIEVED \u2014 the first\nthing you hear since the\ncontract was written.",
  "tools: /goal + /loop (future),\nconductor + sized players\n(today). show-where-we-are\npushed at each piece boundary\nand each stage close.",
  "tools: conductor's spec\nmachinery is today's instance.\nsizing declares tier + effort\n+ why, per piece \u2014 the\nladder's roles made\ncomputable.",
  "tools: none yet \u2014 the gates\nthemselves route. today's only\ngate instance is conductor's\npre-flight inventory.",
  "tools: superpowers\nbrainstorming CAPABILITY\n(2-3 approaches) without its\nwaterfall \u00b7 excalidraw round\ntrip \u00b7 A3 story formats.\nhands to CONTRACT \u2014 never\nwriting-plans.",
  "triage: NEW. one conversation produces docs/product/\nceltic-ticket-exchange.md + .excalidraw: what it is \u00b7 what it must\nbecome \u00b7 the gap (matchday seats sit empty while fans want in) \u00b7\ncomparison \u2014 Twickets, StubHub, the club's own exchange \u00b7 THE\nVALUE, measurable \u00b7 a viability SIGNAL, not a verdict \u00b7 the next\nstage's inputs. grounding: competitor scan + evidence of need +\nwhat we ruled out (empty on day one \u2014 read anyway, by rule).",
  "two axes, both outcome: consequence \u00d7 value. every candidate names\nWHAT WE LOSE by not choosing it; blocked items are separated, not\nranked. the first pick writes itself: the club-authorisation\nconversation \u2014 highest consequence, and it gates everything else\non this page.",
  "view: a choose-what-matters\nboard, regenerated per\ndecision."
